  "finding": "The base four-level decision treats mv and cp as two workspace writes, not as a delete of the source. The provenance wrapper only tightens a decision when the lower-level decision is ask or deny, so the allow survives with sourceLevel contributor and no matched rule. A contributor-source rename therefore removes the target path without an approval."
